<title>UK: SOCCER-LEAGUE CUP SEMIFINAL DRAW.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEAGUE CUP SEMIFINAL DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Draw on Wednesday for the semifnals of the English League Cup:</p>
<p>Stockport or Southampton v Middlesbrough</p>
<p>Ipswich or Leicester v Wimbledon</p>
<p>Ties to be played on Feb 19 and 23 (first legs) and March 12 and 16 (second legs).</p>
</text>
